<title>USA: Mohawk Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Mohawk Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CALHOUN, Ga. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			    Three months ended  Twelve months ended</p>
<p>			    12/31/96 12/31/95  12/31/96   12/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales		$465,638  414,921  1,795,056  1,648,517</p>
<p> Restructuring costs	 700    2,829	  700	8,439</p>
<p>Carrying value reduction of property, plant and</p>
<p>   equipment		 1,710   21,000	3,060     23,711</p>
<p>Compensation expense for stock</p>
<p>   option exercises	  ---    4,000	  ---	4,000</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)    12,517  (10,143)    49,050	6,412</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common</p>
<p>   share			0.36   (0.31)	 1.42	 0.19</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding	    34,827   33,065     34,566     33,623</p>
<p>NOTES: Before extraordinary items, the company had a profit of $13,867,000, or $0.40/shr, vs a profit of $6,916,000, or $0.20/shr, in the quarter and profit of $51,280,000, or $1.48/shr, vs profit of $28,572,000, or $0.84/shr, in year. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
